    },
    {
      "id": "claim_07c5ab96f45f4bbc9230d7f7ac3914c2",
      "statement": "The agent component declares two persistent volume claims — 10Gi for user workspaces and 5Gi for Claude CLI state — both defaulting to ReadWriteOnce.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy/helm/inres/values.yaml#L170-L200",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7c1a1a0598ac94ff4ba0b0bebcf18afa952cb82d9ba304c68454db2b6dfe4780:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1f571fdaddfe43b1828000f49b021f89",
      "statement": "The chart hard-fails rather than warns when autoscaling is enabled for the agent component, because its ReadWriteOnce volumes cannot be mounted by a second pod and because conversation resume reads the CLI transcript on the pod that created the session, so a request landing elsewhere silently starts the conversation cold.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy/helm/inres/templates/hpa.yaml#L19-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:6c936118ba97ea824138d303c7e1a5e9d00183c2418b8092615fa19a8b373e1a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_12e0a44e928146848e91dabbefb31641",
      "statement": "Per-component autoscaling replaced a single release-named HPA left over from helm create which targeted a Deployment that never existed, since every workload is named inres-<component>.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://deploy/helm/inres/templates/hpa.yaml#L1-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:154a02c7b86bfef3daaf1eeaf7b1174bee700946192520dd9279a42e6d6d9c0e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7100bd391fe142dd86806720d15d7ec9",
      "statement": "Every component mounts the shared config.yaml read-only from the inres-secrets Secret rather than a ConfigMap and points its config path environment variable at that mount.",
