    {
      "id": "claim_16c372340485486daef45aa0b6f6ce8b",
      "statement": "The chart's image tag defaults to empty and the deployment template falls back through component tag, global tag, then .Chart.AppVersion, so the chart version and the images it deploys move together and cannot drift apart, with the values file warning that 'latest' must never be used because a rollback would have nothing to roll back to and two nodes pulling at different times could run different code.",
